  "query": "Help me write a detailed report on the current status of remote work in the United States and Europe, with a focus on full-time employment of recent graduates and early-career professionals entering the job market. I want to understand (1) how remote work is affecting entry-level job opportunities and career growth prospects for new professionals, (2) what skills are most often required for remote positions compared to traditional office jobs, (3) how remote work impacts earning potential and professional networking opportunities for people starting their careers, and (4) which industries and companies are most committed to flexible work arrangements. In the report, include comprehensive analysis with extensive references from 2023 onward (including but not limited to recent studies, employment data, industry surveys, and policy reports)."
